### Address Validation API Test Examples
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tools

### Test 1: Valid Address (Versioned)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA"
}

### Test 2: Address with Typos (Should be corrected)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy, Mt View, California"
}

### Test 3: Partial Address
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Times Square, New York"
}

### Test 4: Invalid/Unverifiable Address
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "123 Fake Street, Nowhere, XY 99999"
}

### Test 5: Address Missing Street Number
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Main Street, Boston, MA"
}

### Test 6: Non-US Address (Should be unverifiable)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "10 Downing Street, London, UK"
}

### Test 7: Default endpoint (also works, defaults to v1)
POST http://localhost:3000/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA"
}

### Health Check (not versioned)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### API Info (Versioned)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/validate-address/info

